WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.490
A pesticide leaks into a lake.

2
00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.430
There's only a tiny
trace of it in the water.

3
00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.010
Too little to matter?

4
00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:10.190
Yet the bird of prey at the top
of the food chain ends up with

5
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:11.350
the most.

6
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.130
It can be poisoned, or stop breeding.

7
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:18.030
So why the top predator,
when the trace was so tiny?

8
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.930
In this mission, you'll find out
what living things compete for.

9
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.690
You'll see what happens
to some poisons,

10
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:27.150
and why bees matter
for the food we eat.

11
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.860
Your mission: explain why the top
predator gets the most poison.
